<title>UK: Caradon firms on SBC Warburg &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Caradon firms on SBC Warburg &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British building materials group Caradon Plc advanced 6-1/2p to 255-1/2p in heavy trading on Wednesday after SBC Warburg said it reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; stance on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Analyst Michael Cahill was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
